OL,3,GNEWSAPost-war apartments to be
OL,4,Ademolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to demolish three former apartment
OL,7,Fblocks in Hull is expected to start
OL,8,Fnext week.
OL,10,FHull City Council said Henson Villas,
OL,11,Fon the south eastern edge of Pearson
OL,12,FPark, had become "increasingly
OL,13,Funsuitable for modern housing needs"
OL,14,Fand were "financially unviable" to
OL,15,Frenovate.
OL,17,FCampaigners previously tried to protect
OL,18,Fthe blocks, suggesting they be added to
OL,19,FHull's Local Heritage List of
OL,20,Fhistorically significant buildings.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
