OL,3,GNEWSAPost-war apartments to be
OL,4,Ademolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Paul Drake-Davis said the
OL,7,Fdemolition would reduce anti-social
OL,8,Fbehavior and improve the appearance of
OL,9,Fthe area.
